  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "SBI Card Miles Elite is the advanced variant among the 3 non co-branded travel cards offered by SBI Card and is available at an annual fee of Rs. 4,999. With accelerated rewards on travel spends, point-to-mile conversion ratio of up to 1:1, a low forex mark-up this card offers considerable savings for frequent travellers. Moreover, this card also offers both domestic and international lounge access, along with flight cancellation covers among other travel insurances, thus further cementing its true travel credit card status. But how does this card fare when compared with other travel cards, like Axis Atlas, which provide the consumers with some of the top travel benefits? Here’s a detailed review of the features, benefits and limitations, if any, of SBI Card Miles Elite.",
